  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Statistics for Food Security, Sustainable Agriculture and Rural Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Strategy for improving Statistics for Food Security, Sustainable Agriculture and Rural Development will target 40 African and 20 Asian-Pacific countries. This will develop the capacity of countries to provide better data on improved agriculture and rural statistics. This will allow decisions about investments to boost agricultural growth to be based on sound information and achieve their full potential as drivers for environmentally sustainable growth and poverty reduction.</narrative>
  </description>
